WEBVTT

00:00:04.820 --> 00:00:06.240 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
复制小林发来的会议需求。

00:00:06.322 --> 00:00:08.540 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
点开悬浮球，把需求粘进预约页。

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.250 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
查看空房，核对人数和投影。

00:00:10.277 --> 00:00:11.980 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
选海棠厅，可坐 36 人，有投影。

00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.780 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
确认预约，拿到海棠厅的回执。

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.200 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
复制回执，粘贴回聊天。

00:00:18.289 --> 00:00:20.470 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
把房间和时间发给小林。

00:00:23.991 --> 00:00:24.520 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
从菜单栏展开主页。

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:26.130 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
双击首页空白处，换张壁纸。

00:00:26.277 --> 00:00:27.320 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
打开 MacBook Air 页面，顶栏随页面呈现浅色。

00:00:27.370 --> 00:00:29.500 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
从左向右滑过书签。

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:31.040 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
切到 NASA 月球页，顶栏跟着变暗。

00:00:31.090 --> 00:00:34.100 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
滚动土星照片，看环影从书签栏下穿过。

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.020 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
点右侧「＋」，输入网址。

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:38.150 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
按回车，在第四枚标签里打开月球词条。

00:00:38.277 --> 00:00:40.500 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
按 ⌥⌘R，换到阅读模式。

00:00:40.562 --> 00:00:42.200 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
暂时收起阅读窗口。

00:00:42.277 --> 00:00:44.470 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
点菜单栏图标，从刚才的段落接着读。

00:00:44.562 --> 00:00:45.430 line:88% position:50% size:82% align:center
收起窗口。
